<title>UK: BoE offers to convert 2013/2017 dual maturity gilt.</title>
<headline>BoE offers to convert 2013/2017 dual maturity gilt.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said on Tuesday it would offer to convert holdings of the 12.0 percent Treasury stock due 2013-2017 into 8.0 percent stock due 2015.</p>
<p>It said it would convert stock offered on December 12. The rate of conversion is at the discretion of the Bank.</p>
<p>The price will be announced at 1530 GMT on November 12.</p>
</text>
